==========================================

MULTI-PROJECT .GITIGNORE

Covers: Node.js, NestJS, React Native, Kotlin, Dart/Flutter

==========================================

--- GENERAL & OPERATING SYSTEM FILES ---

.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

--- EDITORS & IDEs ---

.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/
