*.sublime-workspace
.project
.classpath
.settings/

--- LOGS & DIAGNOSTICS ---

.log
npm-debug.log
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
bun-debug.log*

--- NODE.JS & GENERAL JS/TS ---

Dependencies (covers root and subdirectories)

/node_modules/
/jspm_packages/

Build and distribution outputs

/dist/
/build/
/out/
/lib/
*.tsbuildinfo
.npm
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache

Environment variables & secrets

.env
.env
.env.
!.env.example

Testing and coverage

/coverage/
.nyc_output/

Package manager lockfiles (uncomment if you want to ignore lockfiles, though usually they are tracked)

package-lock.json

yarn.lock

pnpm-lock.yaml

